{"D:\\wt\\ssimple2\\vlog\\ssimple2\\voz\\b000_t4.wav": {"text": "This is my mother at 95 in her little kitchen in Osaka, and she lived six more years after this picture. She died at 101 in the same small wooden house where she raised five children. After she turned 60, she did not start a lot of new things. She stopped doing nine things. Today I will tell you all nine, the way she told them to me. And number nine is sitting in your cupboard right now, wrapped in paper, waiting for a day that is never coming. One of them she did every single morning at 6.30 in the park with 40 neighbors. Another one is a little notebook she kept by her pillow for almost 40 years. But first, one honest thing. I cannot promise you 101. Nobody can. This is not advice from a clinic. This is just how one old woman lived, busy and happy, until the very last year.", "words": [{"w": " This", "s": 0.0, "e": 0.24}, {"w": " is", "s": 0.24, "e": 0.44}, {"w": " my", "s": 0.44, "e": 0.58}, {"w": " mother", "s": 0.58, "e": 0.9}, {"w": " at", "s": 0.9, "e": 1.18}, {"w": " 95", "s": 1.18, "e": 1.74}, {"w": " in", "s": 1.74, "e": 2.44}, {"w": " her", "s": 2.44, "e": 2.6}, {"w": " little", "s": 2.6, "e": 2.9}, {"w": " kitchen", "s": 2.9, "e": 3.32}, {"w": " in", "s": 3.32, "e": 3.56}, {"w": " Osaka,", "s": 3.56, "e": 4.58}, {"w": " and", "s": 4.58, "e": 4.6}, {"w": " she", "s": 4.6, "e": 4.78}, {"w": " lived", "s": 4.78, "e": 5.18}, {"w": " six", "s": 5.18, "e": 5.62}, {"w": " more", "s": 5.62, "e": 5.9}, {"w": " years", "s": 5.9, "e": 6.26}, {"w": " after", "s": 6.26, "e": 6.66}, {"w": " this", "s": 6.66, "e": 6.9}, {"w": " picture.", "s": 6.9, "e": 7.28}, {"w": " She", "s": 7.88, "e": 8.02}, {"w": " died", "s": 8.02, "e": 8.42}, {"w": " at", "s": 8.42, "e": 8.68}, {"w": " 101", "s": 8.68, "e": 9.48}, {"w": " in", "s": 9.48, "e": 10.12}, {"w": " the", "s": 10.12, "e": 10.26}, {"w": " same", "s": 10.26, "e": 10.64}, {"w": " small", "s": 10.64, "e": 11.14}, {"w": " wooden", "s": 11.14, "e": 11.48}, {"w"